; THE CONSTELLATION
; Twelve rays make the compass rose; six shorter rays fill its centre.

TO RAY :LENGTH
  FORWARD :LENGTH
  BACK :LENGTH
  RIGHT 30
END

PENUP
HOME
PENDOWN
SETPENWIDTH 2
SETPENCOLOR 90 180 255
REPEAT 12 [RAY 115]

PENUP
HOME
PENDOWN
SETPENWIDTH 1
SETPENCOLOR 255 210 90
REPEAT 6 [RAY 48]

HIDETURTLE
PRINT [Constellation complete: twelve blue rays and six gold.]
